@startuml
title Create Immutable Data Record - Activity Diagram

start
:Receive request with data and schema ID;
:Validate data against schema;
if (Data Valid?) then (yes)
  :Generate unique record ID;
  :Create immutable record;
  :Store record in database;
  :Return record ID;
  stop
else (no)
  :Return error message;
  stop
endif
@enduml